<title>USA: Scripps Bank sets 10 percent stock payout.</title>
<headline>Scripps Bank sets 10 percent stock payout.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scripps Bank said Thursday its board of directors has approved a 10 percent stock dividend for shareholders of record August 7, payable August 28.</p>
<p>The company also said it approved a cash dividend of $0.10 a share to shareholders of record on July 10, payable July 31.</p>
